<title>NETHERLANDS: ROOD TESTHOUSE H1 PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>ROOD TESTHOUSE H1 PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.11 vs   0.19 </p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.78 vs   1.11</p>
<p>    Turnover				62.68 vs  50.34</p>
<p>Note - Dutch semi-conductors test firm Rood Testhouse NV</p>
<p>said that turbulent market conditions in the sector made it</p>
<p>difficult to give a profit forecast, but added that management</p>
<p>at present expected to achieve a small profit over the second</p>
<p>half of 1996.</p>
</text>
